    session_settings.py validates each session independently (--session
    hyprland|pane) so Hyprland starts even if tam-pane.lua is unavailable.

  The repository follows the tam-idol 1.1.0 layout (W16). Source
  installation builds pinned clones, verifies native prerequisites and
  destination ownership, and selects the installed cultivar by digest.
  The shared keybinding standard now lives in tam-idol under
  keys/keybindings.md. The old arch/keybindings.md links to it (W32).


